{
  "job_B8.5.2.1_20251003_114907": {
    "chunk_text": "hw\u00e6t \u00fea cnyhtas cw\u00e6don, hw\u00e6t Hig suwedon & ne cu\u00f0on nane andsware syllan. \u00d0a cw\u00e6\u00f0 se dema eft to \u00feam rynele, Far & swa hwar swa \u00feu hyne gemete, gel\u00e6de hyne in to me. Se rynel \u00fea sona swa dyde, w\u00e6s ut farende & \u00feone H\u00e6lend gemetende & dyde \u00fe\u00e6r \u00f0a eal swa he \u00e6rur Wear\u00f0 \u00feam H\u00e6lende geea\u00f0medende & hym to cwe\u00f0ende, La leof Hlaford, se dema \u00fee het \u00fe\u00e6t \u00f0u Se rynel hyne w\u00e6s swy\u00f0e byddende \u00fe\u00e6t he sceolde in ofer his hr\u00e6gel gan & se leofa H\u00e6lend hyne Ac onmang \u00feam \u00fee he w\u00e6s ingangende hyne w\u00e6ron f\u00e6la manna geea\u00f0medende & heora heafdo to hym Ac Pilatus \u00fea he \u00fe\u00e6t geseah wear\u00f0 swy\u00f0e afyriht & up arysende & utgangende. Ac his wyf hym to sende, \u00fe\u00e6re nama w\u00e6s Procula, & w\u00e6s hym \u00feus to cwe\u00f0ende, ne sig \u00fee & \u00feysum \u00dea \u00f0a Iudeiscan \u00fe\u00e6t gehyrdon \u00fea cw\u00e6don hig to Pilate, nu \u00feu myht \u00fee sylf gehyran \u00fe\u00e6t he ys \u00e6lces Nu he h\u00e6f\u00f0 on sl\u00e6pe \u00feyn wyf gedreht \u00fe\u00e6t heo dwela\u00f0. Pilatus het \u00fea \u00feone H\u00e6lend hym to clypian & hym to cw\u00e6\u00f0, ne gehyrst \u00feu hu f\u00e6la \u00feynga \u00feys folc Se H\u00e6lend hym andswarode & cw\u00e6\u00f0, gif hig myhte n\u00e6fdon ne spr\u00e6con hig na ac manna gehwilc m\u00e6g \u00d0a yldestan Iudeas \u00fe",
